<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Steph Solutions — Développeur Web</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Serif+Display:ital@0;1&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
  <style>
    :root {
      --cream: #FAF8F3;
      --sand: #F0EBE1;
      --warm-white: #FFFDF9;
      --ink: #1A1714;
      --ink-soft: #3D3830;
      --ink-muted: #7A7268;
      --accent: #C85C3A;
      --accent-soft: #E8907A;
      --accent-pale: #F9EDE9;
      --green: #3A7A5C;
      --green-pale: #E8F4EE;
      --border: rgba(26,23,20,0.1);
      --shadow: 0 4px 32px rgba(26,23,20,0.08);
      --radius: 16px;
    }
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body { font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; background: var(--cream); color: var(--ink); overflow-x: hidden; }

    /* NAV */
    nav {
      position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100;
      background: rgba(250,248,243,0.9); backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 0 5vw; height: 68px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .nav-logo { font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif; font-size: 1.35rem; color: var(--ink); letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
    .nav-logo span { color: var(--accent); }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 2.5rem; list-style: none; }
    .nav-links a { text-decoration: none; color: var(--ink-muted); font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.02em; transition: color 0.2s; }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--ink); }
    .nav-cta { background: var(--ink); color: var(--cream) !important; padding: 8px 20px; border-radius: 100px; transition: background 0.2s !important; }
    .nav-cta:hover { background: var(--accent) !important; }

    /* HERO */
    .hero {
      min-height: 100vh; padding: 140px 5vw 80px;
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 4rem; align-items: center;
      position: relative; overflow: hidden;
    }
    .hero::before {
      content: ''; position: absolute; top: -100px; right: -200px;
      width: 700px; height: 700px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(200,92,58,0.08) 0%, transparent 70%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .hero-badge {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      background: var(--green-pale); color: var(--green);
      padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 100px;
      font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem; animation: fadeUp 0.6s ease both;
    }
    .hero-badge::before {
      content: ''; width: 6px; height: 6px; background: var(--green);
      border-radius: 50%; animation: pulse 2s infinite;
    }
    @keyframes pulse { 0%,100%{opacity:1;transform:scale(1)} 50%{opacity:0.5;transform:scale(1.3)} }
    .hero-title {
      font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
      font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 5vw, 4.2rem);
      line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: var(--ink);
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem; animation: fadeUp 0.6s 0.1s ease both;
    }
    .hero-title em { font-style: italic; color: var(--accent); }
    .hero-desc {
      font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--ink-soft);
      max-width: 480px; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; font-weight: 300;
      animation: fadeUp 0.6s 0.2s ease both;
    }
    .hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; animation: fadeUp 0.6s 0.3s ease both; }

    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--accent); color: #fff; border: none;
      padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 100px; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(200,92,58,0.35);
    }
    .btn-primary:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(200,92,58,0.45); }
    .btn-secondary {
      background: transparent; color: var(--ink); border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
      padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 100px; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 500;
      cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s;
    }
    .btn-secondary:hover { border-color: var(--ink); background: var(--sand); }

    /* PROFILE CARD */
    .hero-right { display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; animation: fadeUp 0.6s 0.15s ease both; }
    .profile-card {
      background: var(--warm-white); border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 24px; padding: 2.5rem; width: 100%; max-width: 360px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow); position: relative;
    }
    .profile-avatar {
      width: 80px; height: 80px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-soft), var(--accent));
      border-radius: 20px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif; font-size: 2rem; color: #fff;
    }
    .profile-name { font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif; font-size: 1.35rem; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
    .profile-role { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--ink-muted); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .profile-stats {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem;
      padding-top: 1.5rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .stat { text-align: center; }
    .stat-num { font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif; font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--ink); }
    .stat-label { font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--ink-muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; }
    .profile-tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; margin: 1.25rem 0; }
    .tag { background: var(--sand); color: var(--ink-soft); padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 100px; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 500; }
    .tag.accent { background: var(--accent-pale); color: var(--accent); }
    .floating-badge {
      position: absolute; top: -14px; right: 24px;
      background: var(--ink); color: var(--cream);
      padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 100px; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600;
    }

    /* SECTIONS */
    section { padding: 100px 5vw; }
    .section-label { font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
    .section-title { font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif; font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 3rem); letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.15; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .section-sub { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--ink-muted); line-height: 1.7; max-width: 520px; font-weight: 300; }

    /* COMPETENCES */
    #competences { background: var(--sand); }
    .skills-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; margin-top: 3rem; }
    .skill-card {
      background: var(--warm-white); border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 1.75rem;
      transition: transform 0.25s, box-shadow 0.25s;
    }
    .skill-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
    .skill-icon { width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.4rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .skill-title { font-weight: 600; font-size: 1rem; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .skill-desc { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--ink-muted); line-height: 1.6; }
    .skill-pills { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.4rem; margin-top: 1rem; }
    .pill { background: var(--sand); color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 600; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 100px; }

    /* PROJECTS */
    .projects-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; margin-bottom: 3rem; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; }
    .projects-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr); gap: 1.5rem; }
    .project-card {
      background: var(--warm-white); border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden;
      transition: transform 0.25s, box-shadow 0.25s; cursor: pointer;
    }
    .project-card:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
    .project-card.large { grid-column: span 7; }
    .project-card.small { grid-column: span 5; }
    .project-card.half  { grid-column: span 6; }
    .project-thumb { height: 220px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 3rem; overflow: hidden; }
    .project-body { padding: 1.5rem; }
    .project-meta { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
    .project-type { font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent); }
    .project-year { font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--ink-muted); }
    .project-title { font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif; font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .project-desc { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--ink-muted); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
    .project-stack { display: flex; gap: 0.4rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .project-arrow { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent); margin-top: 1rem; transition: gap 0.2s; }
    .project-card:hover .project-arrow { gap: 10px; }

    /* EXPERIENCE */
    #experience { background: var(--sand); }
    .timeline { margin-top: 3rem; position: relative; padding-left: 2rem; }
    .timeline::before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 12px; bottom: 12px; width: 1.5px; background: var(--border); }
    .timeline-item { position: relative; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; padding-left: 2rem; }
    .timeline-item::before {
      content: ''; position: absolute; left: -2rem; top: 10px;
      width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--cream); border: 2.5px solid var(--accent); transform: translateX(50%);
    }
    .timeline-date { font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
    .timeline-company { font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif; font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 0.2rem; }
    .timeline-role { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--ink-muted); margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
    .timeline-points { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.4rem; }
    .timeline-points li { font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--ink-soft); padding-left: 1rem; position: relative; }
    .timeline-points li::before { content: '->'; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--accent-soft); font-size: 0.75rem; }

    /* CONTACT */
    .contact-inner {
      background: var(--ink); border-radius: 28px; padding: 5rem;
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 4rem; align-items: center;
    }
    .contact-title { font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif; font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 2.8rem); color: var(--cream); letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .contact-title em { color: var(--accent-soft); font-style: italic; }
    .contact-sub { color: rgba(250,248,243,0.55); font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.7; font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    .contact-info { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem; }
    .contact-link { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; color: rgba(250,248,243,0.7); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9rem; transition: color 0.2s; }
    .contact-link:hover { color: var(--cream); }
    .contact-link-icon { width: 36px; height: 36px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-radius: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1rem; }
    .contact-form { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }
    .form-group { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.4rem; }
    .form-group label { font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(250,248,243,0.45); }
    .form-group input, .form-group textarea {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
      border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 16px; color: var(--cream);
      font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.9rem; outline: none;
      transition: border-color 0.2s; resize: none;
    }
    .form-group input::placeholder, .form-group textarea::placeholder { color: rgba(250,248,243,0.25); }
    .form-group input:focus, .form-group textarea:focus { border-color: var(--accent-soft); }
    .form-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; }
    .btn-submit {
      background: var(--accent); color: #fff; border: none;
      padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 100px; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
      transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(200,92,58,0.4); width: 100%;
    }
    .btn-submit:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(200,92,58,0.5); }

    /* FOOTER */
    footer {
      padding: 2rem 5vw; border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem;
    }
    .footer-logo { font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif; font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--ink); }
    .footer-logo span { color: var(--accent); }
    .footer-copy { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--ink-muted); }
    .footer-socials { display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; }
    .social-btn {
      width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 10px;
      background: var(--sand); border: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 0.85rem; cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none; transition: background 0.2s;
    }
    .social-btn:hover { background: var(--accent-pale); }

    @keyframes fadeUp { from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)} to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)} }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding-top: 120px; }
      .hero-right { display: none; }
      .project-card.large, .project-card.small, .project-card.half { grid-column: span 12; }
      .contact-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 2.5rem; }
      .form-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .nav-links { display: none; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav>
  <div class="nav-logo">Steph<span>.</span>Solutions</div>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="#competences">Competences</a></li>
    <li><a href="#projets">Projets</a></li>
    <li><a href="#experience">Experience</a></li>
    <li><a href="#contact" class="nav-cta">Contact</a></li>
  </ul>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-left">
    <div class="hero-badge">Disponible pour freelance</div>
    <h1 class="hero-title">
      Je construis des <em>applications web</em> robustes et elegantes
    </h1>
    <p class="hero-desc">
      Developpeur specialise Laravel et Vue.js, je concois des solutions web sur-mesure, maintenables et performantes et je m'adapte facilement a tout nouvel environnement ou langage.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="#projets" class="btn-primary">Voir mes projets &rarr;</a>
      <a href="#contact" class="btn-secondary">Me contacter</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-right">
    <div class="profile-card">
      <div class="floating-badge">&#10022; Open to work</div>
      <div class="profile-avatar">SS</div>
      <div class="profile-name">Steph Solutions</div>
      <div class="profile-role">Developpeur Web &middot; Laravel &amp; Vue.js</div>
      <div class="profile-tags">
        <span class="tag accent">Laravel</span>
        <span class="tag accent">Vue.js</span>
        <span class="tag">PHP</span>
        <span class="tag">MySQL</span>
        <span class="tag">Adaptable</span>
      </div>
      <div class="profile-stats">
        <div class="stat"><div class="stat-num">5+</div><div class="stat-label">Annees</div></div>
        <div class="stat"><div class="stat-num">42</div><div class="stat-label">Projets</div></div>
        <div class="stat"><div class="stat-num">98%</div><div class="stat-label">Satisfaits</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- COMPETENCES -->
<section id="competences">
  <div class="section-label">Expertises</div>
  <h2 class="section-title">Ce que je maitrise</h2>
  <p class="section-sub">Un ensemble de competences techniques solides pour mener vos projets de A a Z.</p>
  <div class="skills-grid">

    <div class="skill-card">
      <div class="skill-icon" style="background:#FEF3E2;">&#128293;</div>
      <div class="skill-title">Backend &mdash; Laravel</div>
      <div class="skill-desc">Developpement d'APIs REST, applications MVC et back-offices solides avec Laravel, le framework PHP le plus elegant du marche.</div>
      <div class="skill-pills">
        <span class="pill">Laravel</span>
        <span class="pill">PHP</span>
        <span class="pill">Eloquent ORM</span>
        <span class="pill">Artisan</span>
        <span class="pill">Sanctum</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="skill-card">
      <div class="skill-icon" style="background:#E8F4EE;">&#128154;</div>
      <div class="skill-title">Frontend &mdash; Vue.js</div>
      <div class="skill-desc">Interfaces reactives, composants reutilisables et SPAs modernes avec Vue.js et son ecosysteme riche.</div>
      <div class="skill-pills">
        <span class="pill">Vue.js 3</span>
        <span class="pill">Nuxt.js</span>
        <span class="pill">Pinia</span>
        <span class="pill">Vite</span>
        <span class="pill">TailwindCSS</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="skill-card">
      <div class="skill-icon" style="background:#F9EDE9;">&#128450;</div>
      <div class="skill-title">Base de donnees &amp; API</div>
      <div class="skill-desc">Conception de schemas efficaces, requetes optimisees et integrations d'APIs tierces robustes.</div>
      <div class="skill-pills">
        <span class="pill">MySQL</span>
        <span class="pill">PostgreSQL</span>
        <span class="pill">REST API</span>
        <span class="pill">Redis</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="skill-card">
      <div class="skill-icon" style="background:#EEF0FE;">&#129513;</div>
      <div class="skill-title">Adaptabilite et autres langages</div>
      <div class="skill-desc">Je m'adapte rapidement a tout nouvel environnement ou stack technique — c'est l'une de mes vraies forces.</div>
      <div class="skill-pills">
        <span class="pill">React</span>
        <span class="pill">Node.js</span>
        <span class="pill">Python</span>
        <span class="pill">JavaScript</span>
        <span class="pill">Git</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- PROJETS -->
<section id="projets">
  <div class="projects-header">
    <div>
      <div class="section-label">Realisations</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Projets recents</h2>
    </div>
    <a href="#" class="btn-secondary">Voir tout &rarr;</a>
  </div>
  <div class="projects-grid">

    <div class="project-card large">
      <div class="project-thumb" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FFE4D6,#FFB89A);">&#127962;</div>
      <div class="project-body">
        <div class="project-meta">
          <span class="project-type">Application SaaS</span>
          <span class="project-year">2024</span>
        </div>
        <div class="project-title">Gestion RH &amp; Paie</div>
        <div class="project-desc">Application complete de gestion des ressources humaines : contrats, conges, fiches de paie automatisees et tableau de bord admin en temps reel.</div>
        <div class="project-stack">
          <span class="pill">Laravel</span>
          <span class="pill">Vue.js 3</span>
          <span class="pill">MySQL</span>
          <span class="pill">Pinia</span>
        </div>
        <div class="project-arrow">Voir le projet &rarr;</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="project-card small">
      <div class="project-thumb" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#D1EAE0,#8ECBB5);">&#128722;</div>
      <div class="project-body">
        <div class="project-meta">
          <span class="project-type">E-commerce</span>
          <span class="project-year">2024</span>
        </div>
        <div class="project-title">Boutique en ligne</div>
        <div class="project-desc">Plateforme e-commerce avec panier, paiement en ligne et back-office vendeur sous Laravel.</div>
        <div class="project-stack">
          <span class="pill">Laravel</span>
          <span class="pill">Vue.js</span>
          <span class="pill">Stripe</span>
        </div>
        <div class="project-arrow">Voir le projet &rarr;</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="project-card half">
      <div class="project-thumb" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#E8E0FF,#C3B4F5);">&#128203;</div>
      <div class="project-body">
        <div class="project-meta">
          <span class="project-type">Gestion</span>
          <span class="project-year">2025</span>
        </div>
        <div class="project-title">CRM sur-mesure</div>
        <div class="project-desc">Outil CRM personnalise pour PME avec suivi clients, devis et rapports exportables.</div>
        <div class="project-stack">
          <span class="pill">Laravel</span>
          <span class="pill">Nuxt.js</span>
          <span class="pill">PostgreSQL</span>
        </div>
        <div class="project-arrow">Voir le projet &rarr;</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="project-card half">
      <div class="project-thumb" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FFF0CC,#FFD166);">&#127891;</div>
      <div class="project-body">
        <div class="project-meta">
          <span class="project-type">Plateforme</span>
